# Local env files must never reach the build context: they hold
# SHOPPAGE_AUTH_SECRET, the admin password, DATABASE_URL and API keys. The
# runtime receives secrets as environment variables, never baked into layers.
# The `**/` patterns also catch env files in nested service directories.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
